Ecco una landing page HTML/CSS/JS single-file per un negozio di programmazione AI in stile cyberpunk, con modulo contatti e popup di conferma.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI Code · Cyberpunk Store</title>
    <!-- Font futuristico -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #0a0f1e;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            color: #d0f0ff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%),
                repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, #0ff1 2px, #0ff1 3px);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 30px;
        }

        /* Glitch overlay */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, #0ff2 2px, #0ff2 4px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 100;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .card {
            max-width: 700px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(10, 20, 40, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            border: 2px solid #0ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px #0ff4, 0 0 60px #0ff2, inset 0 0 20px #0ff3;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            position: relative;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px #0ff, 0 0 80px #0ff5, inset 0 0 30px #0ff;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-align: center;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #0ff, 0 0 30px #0ff, 0 0 60px #0ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .sub {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #8affff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #0ff6;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .item {
            background: #0b1628;
            border: 1px solid #0ff7;
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            flex: 1 1 130px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #0ff3;
            transition: 0.2s;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #bdfaff;
        }

        .item:hover {
            background: #0f1f35;
            border-color: #0ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px #0ff;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .item span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #7affcc;
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #ffd0f0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff0ff5;
        }

        /* MODULO */
        .form-section {
            background: #0a1428b3;
            border: 1px solid #0ff6;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
        }

        .form-section h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #0ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #0ff;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #9efff0;
        }

        input, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            background: #0a0f1e;
            border: 1px solid #0ff8;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e0f0ff;
            outline: none;
            transition: 0.2s;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 8px #0ff3;
        }

        input:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: #f0f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px #f0f6, inset 0 0 10px #f0f;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 100px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #0ff;
            color: #0a0f1e;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
